\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord Jesus Christ, our Lord most dear,
\par As Thou wast once an infant here,
\par So give this child of Thine, we pray,
\par Thy grace and blessing day by day.
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par \'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O holy Jesus, Lord Divine,
\par We pray Thee guard this child of Thine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. As in Thy heavenly Kingdom, Lord,
\par All things obey Thy sacred word,
\par Do Thou Thy mighty succour give,
\par And shield this child by morn and eve.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O holy Jesus, Lord Divine,
\par We pray Thee guard this child of Thine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Their watch let angels round him keep
\par Where'er he be, awake, asleep;
\par Thy holy cross now let him bear,
\par That he Thy crown with saints may wear.
\par                                    
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O holy Jesus, Lord Divine,
\par We pray Thee guard this child of Thine.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

